
  [1;31mWe've found a bug for you![0m
  [36m/.../fixtures/external_scope_keyword.res[0m:[2m1:1-6[0m

  [1;31m1[0m [2m│[0m [1;31m@scope[0m("class") @val external b: int = "b"
